0113   CA 09 00               JP   Z,ERROR   
0116   CB 4B                  BIT   1,E   ; N should be cleared
0118   C2 09 00               JP   NZ,ERROR   
011B   CB 43                  BIT   0,E   ; C should be cleared
011D   C2 09 00               JP   NZ,ERROR   
0120   C9                     RET   
